le dynamic text."}],[{"t":"text","v":"Escape clears the pending query and closes the popup."}],[{"t":"text","v":"There are no custom Home/End/Page Up/Page Down handlers."}],[{"t":"text","v":"The caret button has an "},{"t":"code","v":"sr-only"},{"t":"text","v":" label from the translation system."}],[{"t":"text","v":"Dynamic-mode blur commits eligible text, does not restore focus, and uses nonmodal focus management. Fixed-option mode uses modal focus management."}]]}],"interaction":[{"k":"p","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Adapted from: Select (Combo). This is a "},{"t":"strong","c":[{"t":"text","v":"searchable combobox adaptation"}]},{"t":"text","v":". It differs from native selects. The checks are source-informed design targets, not executed accessibility tests."}]},{"k":"ul","items":[[{"t":"text","v":"Use search to narrow a long list of known values."}],[{"t":"text","v":"Use "},{"t":"link","href":"/docs/select","c":[{"t":"text","v":"Select"}]},{"t":"text","v":" for a short list. Use "},{"t":"link","href":"/docs/multiselect","c":[{"t":"text","v":"MultiSelect"}]},{"t":"text","v":" for several values."}],[{"t":"text","v":"Enable "},{"t":"code","v":"dynamicOption"},{"t":"text","v":" only when the domain accepts text outside "},{"t":"code","v":"options"},{"t":"text","v":". Tell users that leaving the field commits eligible text."}],[{"t":"text","v":"A persistent "},{"t":"code","v":"title"},{"t":"text","v":" names the field."}],[{"t":"text","v":"Focus, a click or tap on the input, or the caret opens suggestions. Typing filters them."}],[{"t":"text","v":"Enter or a click on an enabled option commits its value and shows its label. The popup closes and the input regains focus."}],[{"t":"text","v":"Hidden options are omitted. Arrow navigation skips disabled options. Pointer and Enter selection reject them."}],[{"t":"text","v":"Keep DOM focus on the combobox. Arrows change the active descendant. Selection state differs from the highlighted result."}],[{"t":"text","v":"In fixed-option